ublic_metrics":{"bookmark_count":14,"impression_count":9455,"like_count":53,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":0},"text":"有个人想付费咨询我：\n我告诉他，我成功的经验是什么。他说：太难了，周期太长。\n我告诉他，别人成功的经验是什么。他说：网上到处都是，不用你说。\n我告诉他，你要从自身发现优势。他说：那我还问你做什么?\n最后，我说：那我告诉你一个绝对赚钱的方法，非常简单，不费力。","url":"https://x.com/Morris_LT/status/2115630540158321042"},{"author_id":"51904755","created_at":"2026-10-29T02:16:10.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115628729498267941"],"id":"2115628729498267941","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":133,"impression_count":12842,"like_count":354,"quote_count":5,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":38},"text":"当你愿意持续投入时间做一件事，那就是你的兴趣。\n当这件事能持续给你带来了满足，那就是你的爱好。\n当你在这件事上形成超常的优势，那就是你的天赋。\n当你用这种优势解决别人的需求，那就是你的价值。\n当别人愿意持续为这种价值付费，那就是你的事业。","url":"https://x.com/Morris_LT/status/2115628729498267941"},{"author_id":"31083308","created_at":"2026-10-29T02:15:40.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115628605619437644"],"id":"2115628605619437644","in_reply_to_user_id":"1720665183188922368","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":10008,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":0},"text":"@grok 毛左在中国是一群什么样的人？","url":"https://x.com/wangwatchworld/status/2115628605619437644"},{"author_id":"31083308","created_at":"2026-10-29T02:14:23.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115628283119464575"],"id":"2115628283119464575","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":5360,"like_count":4,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2115614168116306318","type":"quoted"}],"text":"正好清洗一下粉丝。 https://t.co/vwfCYWQGbp","url":"https://x.com/wangwatchworld/status/2115628283119464575"},{"author_id":"31083308","created_at":"2026-10-29T02:12:19.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115627763436818480"],"id":"2115627763436818480","in_reply_to_user_id":"1720665183188922368","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":6303,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2115625657799696